    <h1>Orientation for Serious Times</h1>
    <p>This site is not built around personality, performance, or factional loyalty. It is a public-facing archive of essays about power, conscience, institutional drift, and the moral cost of looking away.</p>
    <p>Begin with the question that frames the project: what happens when a society keeps arguing about who should wield power, but stops asking whether that power has grown too large to be wielded safely?</p>
